I have completed a Host/Caretaker Incident Report for the visit that occurr=
ed on March 24, 2026. It documents the officers' arrival on restricted fede=
ral land, the interaction at the door, the follow up phone call from the of=
ficer identifying himself as Matt
 Oliver with badge number 555 out of Springfield, his refusal today to prov=
ide the other officers' names and contact information, and the license plat=
e number captured on camera =97 731 QRV.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I have attached a digital copy to this message and would appreciate it if o=
ne of you could pick it up at your earliest convenience. Or perhaps have Ol=
iver meet with me. It is important I learn the identity of these officers.<=
/div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
On a personal note, I am sorry for this trouble, but it is entirely caused =
by others. I am doing what any reasonable person would do when confronted w=
ith this form of abuse of power. If this was legitimate, the officer would =
have provided me with meaningful
 information. It is my belief that if this was not sanctioned, the statute =
posted at that gate was violated.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
